    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d731">

                <pb facs="0869" n="775" sameAs="frus:frus1896/pg775"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Adee to Mr.
                            Williams.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1896-09-03"><hi rendition="#italic">September 3,
                        1896</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>In view of protracted delay in Sanguily case, of disregard of petition preferred
                    by him on suggestion of authorities that it will secure <pb facs="0870" n="776"
                        xml:id="pg776"/> his release, and of acquittal of Gerardo Portela, jointly
                    accused with him of kidnapping, the Department feels compelled to demand his
                    immediate trial or release.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
